## Common Fly.io Pitfalls & Fixes

| Symptom                                                 | Root Cause                                                                      | Fix                                                                                         |
| ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `Cannot find module '/app/prisma'` in `release_command` | Prisma CLI symlink expects a folder named `prisma`.                               | Copy `node_modules/prisma` to `/app/prisma` **and** move schema to `/app/db/schema.prisma` in Dockerfile. |
| `default level:info must be included...` on Fly         | Fly's `LOG_LEVEL` env is upper-case (`INFO`) which breaks Pino logger.            | Coerce to lower-case in `lib/logger.ts`: `level: (process.env.LOG_LEVEL || 'info').toLowerCase()` |
| OOM during migrations                                   | Release VM default memory is too low (≈256MB).                                  | Set `[vm] memory_mb = 512` in `fly.toml`.                                                   |
